    <string name="about_privacy_summary">Strictly read-only, zero background services, no telemetry</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Vigil is a strictly read-only diagnostic tool with zero background services, no persistent notifications, and no telemetry or analytics.\n\nDiagnostic observations stay local on your device. Network access occurs only when you explicitly run a network check (mtalk.google.com) or tap Check for updates (GitHub Releases API).</string>
